  "title": "Union Bankshares Announces Earnings for the three months and year ended December 31, 2024 and Declares Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "MORRISVILLE, Vt., Jan. 15, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Union Bankshares, Inc. (NASDAQ - UNB) today announced results for the three months and year ended December 31, 2024 and declared a regular quarterly cash dividend. Consolidated net income for the three months ended December 31, 2024 was $3.00 million, or $0.67 per share, compared to $3.05 million, or $0.68 per share, for the same period in 2023, and $8.8 million, or $1.94 per share, for the year ended December 31, 2024, compared to $11.3 million",
